# Fleet-buy hand-off (purchased SIDs, machine-local state — not a secret, not source).
# The glob also covers the atomic-write sibling fleet-buy.json.tmp, which only
# survives a crash mid-purchase — exactly when a stray `git add -A` is most likely.
fleet-buy.json*

